{"id":"8ee22b56cc1189dc","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-natural-numbers-object.md","title":"Definition — 自然数对象与递归泛性质","display":"Definition — 自然数对象与递归泛性质","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-natural-numbers-object","aliases":["14-df-natural-numbers-object"],"display":"Definition — 自然数对象与递归泛性质","source_ref":"VI.1, pp.268–270","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-elementary-topos]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-natural-numbers-object"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-natural-numbers-object</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 自然数对象与递归泛性质"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"VI.1, pp.268–270"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。候选结构为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(N,z:1\\to N,s:N\\to N)\">\\((N,z:1\\to N,s:N\\to N)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为任意对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:1\\to A\">\\(a:1\\to A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:A\\to A\">\\(h:A\\to A\\)</span> 为递归数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathcal E}(N,z,s)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp; N\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\land z\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(1,N)\\land s\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N,N)\\\\\n\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall a:1\\to A\\;\\forall h:A\\to A\\;\\exists!u:N\\to A\\;(u\\circ z=a\\land u\\circ s=h\\circ u).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathcal E}(N,z,s)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp; N\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\land z\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(1,N)\\land s\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N,N)\\\\\n\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall a:1\\to A\\;\\forall h:A\\to A\\;\\exists!u:N\\to A\\;(u\\circ z=a\\land u\\circ s=h\\circ u).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>自然数对象是“给定初值和一步递归后唯一求值”的泛性质，不是从“初等拓扑斯”这一名称自动取得的对象。有限集拓扑斯没有这样的对象：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个元素，取目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 个元素的循环，初值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>、递归为加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。递归方程迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u(s^kz)=k\\bmod(n+1)\">\\(u(s^kz)=k\\bmod(n+1)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le k\\le n\">\\(0\\le k\\le n\\)</span>），因而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 中有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 个不同元素，矛盾。Grothendieck 拓扑斯的自然数对象可由常自然数预层层化得到，原书说明它同构于可数份终对象的余积。此处定义本身不预设任何候选自然数对象已经存在。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，VI.1, pp.268–270。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"(N,z:1\\to N,s:N\\to N)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"a:1\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"h:A\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathcal E}(N,z,s)\\Longleftrightarrow{}& N\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\land z\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(1,N)\\land s\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N,N)\\\\\n\n&\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall a:1\\to A\\;\\forall h:A\\to A\\;\\exists!u:N\\to A\\;(u\\circ z=a\\land u\\circ s=h\\circ u).\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"u(s^kz)=k\\bmod(n+1)","display":false},{"tex":"0\\le k\\le n","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false}],"bytes":1942,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-numbers-object|df-226 — 自然数对象与递归泛性质]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-numbers-object]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-162","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-numbers-object]]"},{"id":"d0faa5e1a984aebe","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，选定终对象、二元积及投影 $p_{A,B}:A\\times B\\to A$、$q_{A,B}:A\\times B\\to B$。$(N,z,s)$ 满足 [[14-df-natural-numbers-object]] 的 $\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathcal E}(N,z,s)$；$+_N,\\times_N:N\\times N\\to N$ 为 [[14-df-nno-arithmetic]] 在该零与后继结构上构造的两条箭头。所有以下带 $N$ 下标的构造同时依赖已经固定的 $\\mathcal E,z,s$ 及积选择。"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-numbers-object]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-numbers-object|df-226 — 自然数对象与递归泛性质]]"},{"id":"2e8e6cd022ad4f84","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c54d379516c87001","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"72d2de02f3f75f65","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c6902dd0863cb754","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"439f1bdb1c7fbb2e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯；$(N,z,s)$、$(N',z',s')$ 均满足 [[14-df-natural-numbers-object]] 的 $\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathcal E}$，使用同一个选定终对象 $1$。"}],"outgoing":["4e6c05c92e3b9bf9"]}